        <mxCell id="u5hwWNJZQtQhvhjYngw9-12" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;Enrich and Decompose&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;Takes user input and enriches it by elobrating the query.&lt;br&gt;asking for point in favour and againt i,e point and counter point.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Decomposes the Enriches query into points that can be used for data gathering though web searches.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Implenets generate and createq pattern we do one pass of createqing and ask for any gaps and mssing topics that shuold be incuded&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
