        <mxCell id="u5hwWNJZQtQhvhjYngw9-52" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;Report writter&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;We will implement a Generate and we will generate a report and createq it for points that should be fact cehcked. points that demand more sources or are missnig source. resolves points that contradict eachother&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
