        <mxCell id="u5hwWNJZQtQhvhjYngw9-65" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;div&gt;### Overview&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Build an agent that autonomously plans research questions, retrieves papers, summarises findings, extracts insights, and writes structured research reports.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;The solution should help researchers, analysts, and knowledge workers accelerate literature review and synthesis.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;### Core Challenge&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Research planning quality, retrieval relevance, citation-awareisation, and coherent synthesis across sources.&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
